  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Proposal of reform to the public policy and legal framework of territorial planning in Colombia in order to comply with the Paris Agreement</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The extension of the project made a technical proposal for the 5 largest agglomeration areas of the country: Bogot&#xe1;, Medell&#xed;n, Cali, Barranquilla and Bucaramanga, regarding the location of the potential expansion areas and the coordination mechanism necessary to implement it in terms of of deforestation, the connection between risk factors and deforestation trends has been studied in five municipalities. In the extension of the project, 10 additional municipalities with high levels of deforestation were analyzed.</narrative>
  </description>
